  "normalized_prose": "Typed legal rule: tdfol/tdfol_default.\nTypes: EventFrame, Object, TimeFrame.\nPredicate AssignedTo: assigned_personnel of type Object; assigned_organization of type Object.\nPredicate CorpsEngineers: proposed_corps_entity of type Object.\nPredicate Detail: detailing_authority of type Object; detailed_personnel of type Object; detail_frame of type EventFrame; time_index of type TimeFrame.\nPredicate DistrictColumbia: proposed_district_entity of type Object.\nPredicate DutiesOf: duties_collection of type Object; duties_holder of type Object.\nPredicate MayorOf: beneficiary_office_holder of type Object; district of type Object.\nPredicate Member: counted_personnel of type Object; counting_event_frame of type EventFrame; counting_time_index of type TimeFrame.\nPredicate Officer: personnel_member of type Object.\nPredicate President: authority_holder of type Object.\nPredicate PurposeAssistInDischarging: detail_frame of type EventFrame; assisting_personnel of type Object; beneficiary_office_holder of type Object; duties_collection of type Object; time_index of type TimeFrame.\nRule: (for every event of type EventFrame, (for every time of type TimeFrame, (for every president of type Object, (for every mayor of type Object, (for every corps of type Object, (for every district of type Object, (if (both (both (both (both (President holds for authority_holder: president of type Object) and (CorpsEngineers holds for proposed_corps_entity: corps of type Object)) and (DistrictColumbia holds for proposed_district_entity: district of type Object)) and (MayorOf holds for beneficiary_office_holder: mayor of type Object; district: district of type Object)) and (for every x0 of type Object, (for every x1 of type Object, (for every x2 of type Object, (for every x3 of type Object, (if (both (both (both (Member holds for counted_personnel: x0 of type Object; counting_event_frame: event of type EventFrame; counting_time_index: time of type TimeFrame) and (Member holds for counted_personnel: x1 of type Object; counting_event_frame: event of type EventFrame; counting_time_index: time of type TimeFrame)) and (Member holds for counted_personnel: x2 of type Object; counting_event_frame: event of type EventFrame; counting_time_index: time of type TimeFrame)) and (Member holds for counted_personnel: x3 of type Object; counting_event_frame: event of type EventFrame; counting_time_index: time of type TimeFrame)) then (either (either (either (either (either (x0 of type Object is identical to x1 of type Object) or (x0 of type Object is identical to x2 of type Object)) or (x0 of type Object is identical to x3 of type Object)) or (x1 of type Object is identical to x2 of type Object)) or (x1 of type Object is identical to x3 of type Object)) or (x2 of type Object is identical to x3 of type Object)))))))) then (it is permitted that (there exists duties of type Object such that (both (DutiesOf holds for duties_collection: duties of type Object; duties_holder: mayor of type Object) and (for every officer of type Object, (if (Member holds for counted_personnel: officer of type Object; counting_event_frame: event of type EventFrame; counting_time_index: time of type TimeFrame) then (both (both (both (Officer holds for personnel_member: officer of type Object) and (AssignedTo holds for assigned_personnel: officer of type Object; assigned_organization: corps of type Object)) and (Detail holds for detailing_authority: president of type Object; detailed_personnel: officer of type Object; detail_frame: event of type EventFrame; time_index: time of type TimeFrame)) and (PurposeAssistInDischarging holds for detail_frame: event of type EventFrame; assisting_personnel: officer of type Object; beneficiary_office_holder: mayor of type Object; duties_collection: duties of type Object; time_index: time of type TimeFrame)))))))))))))).",
